+/* ---- FTM5 wake, calibrate, host interrupt: what a pin reset does not do ------------------------- */
+
+/*
+ * A reset pulse only brings the application up. It leaves the analogue front
+ * end asleep and uncalibrated, and the host interrupt is not routed to the
